  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). Inspectors use it to draw and confirm porosity, crack and inclusion boxes on weld X-ray images, train a YOLO11 detector on the confirmed boxes, and use that model or a morphology heuristic to suggest defect candidates that a person must review. Data used in the run: synthetic. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
